[{"title":"赠吴梅梁 其二","author":"释今无","text":"绿玉千丛掠碧空，嵩山千树自无功。\n他年却与松枝比，岁岁为君记一丛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47911,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠吴梅梁 其三","author":"释今无","text":"明月流光碧海宽，大千入手只如丸。\n雄才自得灵山气，不羡仙人有大丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47912,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠吴梅梁 其四","author":"释今无","text":"山前檀越寺中僧，十里香花结未曾。\n千古交情在霄汉，几回深浅记蓬瀛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47913,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜吼万慧均二公从匡庐奉佛舍利还 其一","author":"释今无","text":"脚底何曾路不平，薰风秋气往来轻。\n珠江吞却鄱阳月，百粤长空万古明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47914,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜吼万慧均二公从匡庐奉佛舍利还 其二","author":"释今无","text":"敲破玻瓈见至祥，多君顶戴客途长。\n一寸香消秋未老，蒲团若个较閒忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47915,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜吼万慧均二公从匡庐奉佛舍利还 其三","author":"释今无","text":"何曾幻相是如来，好眼当从幻处开。\n惊得莲花抽宝燄，大千无地着寒灰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47916,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜吼万慧均二公从匡庐奉佛舍利还 其四","author":"释今无","text":"正当实处俱成幻，万法虚时亦是真。\n须信舌头原没骨，撑起如来正法轮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47917,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其一","author":"释今无","text":"家园话到泪先垂，望断浮云身縻羁。\n十二年前犹记得，沈香浦上进亲时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47918,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其二","author":"释今无","text":"破巢之后事全迂，纵有琼浆不忍图。\n枝上分明阿母血，至今和泪滴珊瑚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47919,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其三","author":"释今无","text":"蓬山翠实那堪比，合浦明珰不易求。\n一种绛绡包不得，幽香妒杀水晶毬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47920,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其四","author":"释今无","text":"冰霜为骨血为衣，朅向炎邦寄翠微。\n多少官桥人不识，夜深疑作岭霞飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47921,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其五","author":"释今无","text":"捧出冰盘荐客初，酡颜腻理转容与。\n轻罗未剥香先溢，不信仙人有白鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47922,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其六","author":"释今无","text":"有香有色蕴仙葩，锦石山前百姓家。\n六龙辛苦西王母，错向昆崙洗玉瓜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47923,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其七","author":"释今无","text":"冰肌玉质已多情，羞向花田斗素馨。\n纵到蓝桥甘玉液，裴郎犹未识云英。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47924,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其八","author":"释今无","text":"中原何处不纷纷，嘉名耻尔号将军。\n可怜斗气光无力，望到扶桑也是云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47925,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其九","author":"释今无","text":"渔阳朔气胜金刀，四百朱明入梦高。\n云水如今都是恨，劝君莫忆紫罗袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47926,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其十","author":"释今无","text":"石亭新结画桥东，夏日生涯树色中。\n翡翠入林人不见，啄残数颗喙先红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47927,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其十一","author":"释今无","text":"赠人为觅路头花，未出榕桥噪晚鸦。\n回看小姑閒荡桨，斜阳明灭一溪霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47928,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其十二","author":"释今无","text":"状元红与尚书怀，抛掷如泥满六街。\n笑他八十山中叟，只爱香城红绣鞋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47929,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其十三","author":"释今无","text":"帘外春深蕊气通，月明南浦思无穷。\n芙蓉岂是无颜色，除却冰心一样红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47930,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其十四","author":"释今无","text":"一曲歌残唐祚衰，华清犹见草萋萋。\n佳人本爱徵方物，好把虬珠付马蹄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47931,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其十五","author":"释今无","text":"浓浓数树荫溪流，蛋女乘潮过小舟。\n偷得一枝无着处，殷勤系在绿裙头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47932,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其十六","author":"释今无","text":"临风几度倚仙厨，探得骊龙第一珠。\n我欲殷勤问王母，不知天上有愁无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47933,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其十七","author":"释今无","text":"生来只合寄长林，嫩绿娇红总不禁。\n莫握雪团供炎热，恐先镕却见侬心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47934,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其十八","author":"释今无","text":"黑叶浓浓味亦殊，凝冰市上自来无。\n惟馀粤秀山前种，卖与城中变酪酥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47935,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其十九","author":"释今无","text":"寒食东风绕竹扉，濛濛细雨逐花飞。\n黄莺不解人心事，偏向枝头刷羽衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47936,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其二十","author":"释今无","text":"时当夏至荐芳馨，才入秋风味便轻。\n幼女不知颜色好，等閒裁作绛纱灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47937,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其二十一","author":"释今无","text":"一回寒梦到仙羊，认得溪头旧日香。\n朔气打窗惊又醒，分明失却五云浆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47938,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其二十二","author":"释今无","text":"玉质能生别样醝，一杯未了觉颜酡。\n黄河若肯清流水，千日中山岂是多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47939,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其二十三","author":"释今无","text":"呼鸾道上海云蒸，十亩胭脂昨夜凝。\n无数蛾眉齐议得，绛仙曳出耀光绫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47940,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其二十四","author":"释今无","text":"采得明珰掌上寒，玉膏溢渍竟谁看。\n自顾自怜还自惜，分明记得倚栏干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47941,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其二十五","author":"释今无","text":"斜狎渔矶倚太阳，茏葱风色亦生凉。\n板桥听到蝉声急，不数阶前王者香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47942,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其二十六","author":"释今无","text":"流花桥上水潺潺，纵食珠玑不解颜。\n精卫血多君莫比，填穷沧海恨难删。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47943,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其二十七","author":"释今无","text":"积翠楼头火树红，汉家旧事已成空。\n空馀一片啼魂血，洒向炎方粤峤中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47944,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其二十八","author":"释今无","text":"金屋何人贮阿娇，望中宫阙自飘飖。\n劝君合却漂零眼，随我还山劈荔蕉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47945,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其二十九","author":"释今无","text":"御沟云气欲成霖，寂寂虚亭起晚阴。\n残梦几曾消得尽，又将红色系人心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47946,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支诗 其三十","author":"释今无","text":"芳辞吟罢报君知，秋到天涯鬓易丝。\n莫向月明弹宝剑，浮生终拟欲何为。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47947,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠项进其 其一","author":"释今无","text":"白岳真人降紫云，一星今见岭南分。\n回看申甫俱凡质，魏宝隋珠已属君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47948,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠项进其 其二","author":"释今无","text":"五良原自振芳声，双眼谁传项氏名。\n彩笔雕弓皆好手，须知千古有云礽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47949,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄端四大士祝词 其一","author":"释今无","text":"玉麈长挥意气中，白门春色古今同。\n法交却得如金石，七宝莲花一朵红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47950,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄端四大士祝词 其二","author":"释今无","text":"鹤语先从白下过，何人戴得瑞光多。\n心胸不数陈同父，万里云霄一太阿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47951,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄端四大士祝词 其三","author":"释今无","text":"黄金台上未生尘，郭乐回看不计春。\n一颗寒星离宝月，欣君却是太平人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47952,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄端四大士祝词 其四","author":"释今无","text":"挟得明珠烁太虚，棘津何事尚为渔。\n狗监徒识文园赋，天禄何人解读书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47953,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄端四大士祝词 其五","author":"释今无","text":"横阔乾坤镜象中，齐听众窍奏天风。\n只今帷幄深深处，一着真回造化工。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47954,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄端四大士祝词 其六","author":"释今无","text":"慈心密行见津梁，碧海如杯湿大荒。\n万顷邓林春色好，岂知庭树已成行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47955,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄端四大士祝词 其七","author":"释今无","text":"匣底芙蓉泛雪波，笔花终古薄银河。\n丈夫身量知多少，不向麒麟阁上过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47956,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄端四大士祝词 其八","author":"释今无","text":"支遁真同许掾游，如今芳迹在浮丘。\n银缸几度羲皇话，却笑彭篯易白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47957,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄端四大士祝词 其九","author":"释今无","text":"贝叶花开菊又黄，雁声历历起寒塘。\n珊瑚洲上云千叠，都向君家绕画梁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47958,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠沈石友醝使 其一","author":"释今无","text":"灵光拈得贯长虚，二酉何劳万卷书。\n不着字时文已露，大千春色满庭除。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47959,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠沈石友醝使 其二","author":"释今无","text":"扶桑东望挂长虹，子晋缑山杳霭中。\n最是近来潇洒甚，箫声吹起大鹏风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47960,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠沈石友醝使 其三","author":"释今无","text":"威光黄绶智珠藏，秋菊犹开九日香。\n久共侍郎松下语，却疑此地是钱塘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47961,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠沈石友醝使 其四","author":"释今无","text":"鹤语高空彻夜闻，千年词赋沈休文。\n閒僧欲乞郎官笔，为榻嵩山万斛云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47962,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿刘焕之 其一","author":"释今无","text":"老阴消尽少阳回，恰值花枝刺眼开。\n为问六经谈底事，更无人共上高台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47963,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿刘焕之 其二","author":"释今无","text":"费然春色满乾坤，穆穆熙熙此处尊。\n近说东风花信转，熙熙穆穆付儿孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47964,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿刘焕之 其三","author":"释今无","text":"画戟门开见堕仙，回看万里月还圆。\n黄金有甲重增色，不向麒麟阁上悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47965,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿刘焕之 其四","author":"释今无","text":"千寻玉井夜波寒，直搆巍楼里面看。\n子晋鹤归无路入，箫声吹彻满栏干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47966,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿刘焕之 其五","author":"释今无","text":"神鹍奋翼过南溟，九万乘风掠处轻。\n却比三山还较重，六鳌着力不能擎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47967,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿刘焕之 其六","author":"释今无","text":"二丸不及此时光，是地风行万物昌。\n纯驳总来窥不到，不须人更颂羲皇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47968,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿刘焕之 其七","author":"释今无","text":"理得寒江百尺丝，金鳞钓得不为奇。\n何如坐却天边月，万籁无声风自吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47969,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿刘焕之 其八","author":"释今无","text":"独卓金旌不用扶，灵鼍一击万人呼。\n铁关虽藉金城固，若个人悬碧玉符。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47970,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿刘焕之 其九","author":"释今无","text":"万石黄金大冶中，邓林作炭彻天红。\n何人下得神仙手，一拨深回造化工。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47971,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿刘焕之 其十","author":"释今无","text":"昆崙碧树自青葱，神雀高飞不着踪。\n夜半天南吹玉笛，无人侧耳过洪濛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47972,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿刘焕之 其十一","author":"释今无","text":"知音世上岂能任，剖出洪濛见古今。\n管鲍若能知此意，错教管鲍许同心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47973,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿刘焕之 其十二","author":"释今无","text":"骨肉平生我独孤，苦持斯道有人无。\n只今虚却松门月，却许君心照玉壶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47974,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仞千以贺章见投短章答之 其一","author":"释今无","text":"砻得新硎振旧家，先行我已愧泥沙。\n神羊挂起无寻处，万斛天风吹海霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47975,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仞千以贺章见投短章答之 其二","author":"释今无","text":"支离久已蹶尘埃，蹀躞欣从大宛来。\n好领白眉归上界，天花填路鸟衔开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47976,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠用弥 其一","author":"释今无","text":"东湖湖上拥高幢，湖色山光一并降。\n借问主人年几几，干支数尽又逢双。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47977,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠用弥 其二","author":"释今无","text":"精严洁白一庵深，云树那知静者心。\n午夜月明叩金磬，莲花千叶杳难寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47978,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王默庵明府 其一","author":"释今无","text":"瞠开双眼坐乾坤，此地何曾解困人。\n宽却肚皮横着枕，江山云物不胜春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47979,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王默庵明府 其二","author":"释今无","text":"但得衣襟尚有心，从教苦乐自相侵。\n无弦我亦怜同调，手眼依稀有素琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47980,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王默庵明府 其三","author":"释今无","text":"不移苦节不知长，杉叶青青自带霜。\n谁薄蟪蛄与朝菌，何如椿树两相忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47981,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王默庵明府 其四","author":"释今无","text":"便便坦腹自深情，况复多才世泽清。\n试问冶长当日意，也须无语对秋灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47982,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王默庵明府 其五","author":"释今无","text":"击案同君水一杯，爱君住劫贯风雷。\n分明一纸悲秋赋，只当长歌读几回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47983,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王默庵明府 其六","author":"释今无","text":"黄金台畔倚仙人，万里风云入眼新。\n为报绨袍问秋扇，可须还掩马头尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47984,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王默庵明府 其七","author":"释今无","text":"应须泼墨写霜条，青玉琅琅欲压霄。\n学得十年行脚意，如王气宇未全消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47985,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠曾仪文相士 其一","author":"释今无","text":"诸根鼻舌吾无取，牝牡骊黄君更精。\n两眼何曾逃两眼，龙楼空自煞分明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47986,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠曾仪文相士 其二","author":"释今无","text":"叔服如今又姓曾，金椎玉枕辨尤能。\n多君摘理无言处，嘿领丹梯最上层。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47987,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题雪竹赠人 其一","author":"释今无","text":"罗浮遍岭自离披，葛令丹砂炼熟时。\n长得筼筜千万斛，雪深应有凤凰知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47988,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]